---
// Site-wide footer — quiet, metadata-sized.
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-border-subtle">
    <div
        class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-8 gap-y-2 px-6 py-8"
    >
        <p class="m-0 text-small text-content-muted">
            gpui-archipelago — every fork is an island. Here they can find each
            other.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 font-mono text-small text-content-muted">
            <a
                class="text-content-muted hover:text-action"
                href="https://github.com/gpui-archipelago"
                >github.com/gpui-archipelago</a
            >
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
            <a
                class="text-content-muted hover:text-action"
                href="https://discord.gg/bcuR88Z8ku">discord</a
            >
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>still extremely alpha
        </p>
    </div>
</footer>
